# Copy to .env for local runs (`make run` loads it).
# On Coolify, set these as service environment variables instead.

# Listen address (default :8080)
# ADDR=:8080

# SQLite path for shopping list + TODO (chores/stars). Default: ./data/hq.db
# On Coolify, mount a persistent volume at /data and set:
# HQ_DB_PATH=/data/hq.db
# HQ_DB_PATH=./data/hq.db

# Home coordinates for live Open-Meteo weather (omit to use seed weather)
WEATHER_LAT=49.2827
WEATHER_LON=-123.1207

# Poll interval (Go duration; default 15m)
# WEATHER_REFRESH=15m

# Shared secret for POST /internal/garmin (required for live Garmin ingest)
# HQ_INGEST_TOKEN=change-me

# --- Dashboard login (optional) ---
# Shared household password. When set, browsers must unlock before /ws connects.
# Session cookie lasts ~1 year (survives reloads and version updates).
# HQ_PASSWORD=change-me
# Optional signing key; if unset, derived from HQ_PASSWORD (password change invalidates sessions).
# HQ_AUTH_SECRET=

# --- Google Calendar (read-only) ---
# One-time auth: GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=... GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=... go run ./cmd/gcal-auth
# Enable Calendar API; OAuth Desktop client; account must see personal + family calendars.
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=
# GOOGLE_REFRESH_TOKEN=
# Calendar IDs (Settings → Integrate calendar). Lanes are Mayura + Family only.
# GCAL_MAYURA=
# GCAL_FAMILY=
# GCAL_DENISE is unused (Denise stays on todos only).
# Poll interval / window (Go duration or Nd days; defaults 15m, 7d past, 60d future)
# GCAL_REFRESH=15m
# GCAL_WINDOW_PAST=7d
# GCAL_WINDOW_FUTURE=60d

# --- Plan My Day (Mayura agenda; complete / reschedule from event sheet) ---
# PLAN_MY_DAY_URL=https://plan-my-day.edgeanalytics.app
# PLAN_MY_DAY_API_KEY=pmy_…
# PLAN_MY_DAY_REFRESH=15m

# --- Garmin sidecar (services/garmin/poller.py) ---
# Poller auto-loads this file (repo-root .env) or services/garmin/.env.
# Run: cd services/garmin && python -m venv .venv && .venv/Scripts/activate
#   pip install -r requirements.txt && python poller.py
# GARMIN_EMAIL=
# GARMIN_PASSWORD=
# GARMIN_TOKEN_DIR=./.garmin-tokens
# HQ_URL=http://localhost:8080
# HQ_INGEST_TOKEN=change-me
# GARMIN_REFRESH=15m
# GARMIN_DISPLAY_NAME=

# --- Sports (TheSportsDB; feeds Home sports strip) ---
# Comma-separated watchlist: team:<name|id> or league:<name|id> (competition: also accepted).
# Names resolve at startup. Example: NZ Warriors + Rugby League World Cup.
# SPORTS_WATCH=team:New Zealand Warriors,league:Rugby League World Cup
# Optional API key (default free key 123). Premium keys return richer schedule endpoints.
# SPORTS_API_KEY=123
# Poll interval (Go duration; default 30m)
# SPORTS_REFRESH=30m
